Subject: [PATCH 27/34] [3.1.1] [M156] [SPC] Own
 SecurePaymentConfirmationAppFactory::Request on UI thread

Original change's description:
> [SPC] Own SecurePaymentConfirmationAppFactory::Request on UI thread
>
> Previously, SecurePaymentConfirmationAppFactory passed unique ownership
> of Request (a WebContentsObserver) into the callback passed to
> GetMatchingCredentials(). If the underlying WebDataRequest was cancelled
> before running, WebDatabaseBackend::DBReadTaskWrapper() destroyed the
> callback and Request on the background DB sequence, racing on
> WebContentsImpl::observers_.
>
> Keep Request owned by SecurePaymentConfirmationAppFactory on the UI
> thread and bind a WeakPtr<Request> into the callbacks, including
> DidDownloadIcon().
>
> Fixed: 575395237
> Change-Id: Iee94dab669c5011b39232abfe2a6090c7bf25b83
> Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8659078
